                    <li><b>Journey to city center: </b>30-40 minutes with one transfer</li>
                    <li><b>Operates: </b>6:00 AM to 1:30 AM</li>
                </ul>
                <h4>Cercanías Commuter Rail</h4>
                <p>Line C-1 connects Terminal 4 to key Madrid stations including Chamartín, Nuevos Ministerios, Atocha, and Príncipe Pío.</p>
